%N A399849 Expansion of e.g.f. log((1 - log(1+x))/(1 - 2*log(1+x)))/(1 - log(1+x)).
%H A399849 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/StirlingTransform.html">Stirling Transform</a>.
%F A399849 Sum_{k=0..n} Stirling2(n,k)*a(k) = A103213(n).
%F A399849 a(n) ~ 2*(n-1)! / (exp(1/2) - 1)^n. - _Vaclav Kotesovec_, Sep 13 2026
%t A399849 CoefficientList[Series[Log[(1-Log[1+x])/(1-2Log[1+x])]/(1-Log[1+x]),{x,0,22}],x]*Range[0,22]!
%Y A399849 Row sums of A399848.
